// Windows resources for the dashboard executable.
//
// The icon is the dashboard's own Xbox logo, taken from the dumped assets
// (Metro/DashcommAssets/xboxLogo.png) and converted to a multi-size .ico. The
// source is 300x196, so it is letterboxed onto a transparent square rather than
// stretched -- Explorer, the taskbar and Alt-Tab each pick the size they want.
//
// ID 1: the lowest-numbered icon resource is the one Windows uses for the
// executable, so this must stay first.
1 ICON "nxe.ico"
